do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_visible()
[i]You awaken confused in a small, simple room, surrounded by five other people.[/i]\
[i]All of you gather yourselves and look around - there's an intercom and a door, but little else.[/i]\
[i]Suddenly, a voice rings out over the loudspeaker.[/i]
Intercom: Hello, everyone! Welcome to the game!\
I'm sure you have questions, but let's not worry about them for now. \
In ten minutes the first round of our game will start. You'll have to work together to select one of you as the loser.\
That loser will be eliminated as a result.
ManWithGlasses: Round of what? What game? What the hell is this??
Intercom: We'll have five rounds all together, with the last person remaining being the winner! When the game begins, the door will open. Good luck!
[i]Your initial glance around the room reveals the door and intercom are the only features of the walls, no other exits, even windows or vents.[/i]\
[i]Slowly, tentatively, each of you gather and introduce yourselves. A group discussion begins to form.[/i]
Artsy: So nobody remembers anything about what this is or how they got here?
Nerd: No! I'm freaking out a bit, I normally have a great memory! I'm so confused-
Jock: Calm down! I've got a killer headache. Someone's probably playing a prank on us or something, it's chill.
[i]You look over at the man in a varsity jacket. He's trying to play it cool but his twitching gives away the pain of what looks to be a migraine.[/i]
Mean: Yeah, don't pee your pants, we're gonna be fine.
Nice: Nobody's even injured, by the looks of it - if they wanted to hurt us they probably wouldn't have brought us here so smoothly. They even left us some medical supplies. I'm sure they mean us no real harm, right?
Artsy: This one's awfully quiet.
[i]He nods at you, and everyone glances your way.[/i]
Nice: We're all a little bit stunned, give them a minute.
Nerd: A little??
Mean: Oh my god, will you ever-
Jock: Okay! Cool it! Everyone walk it off and take a breath before whatever the hell is coming up happens.
[i]Everyone backs off, and people start to pair off in short conversations. You decide to strike up a chat with some of them in the time you have before the game starts.[/i]
do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_captured()
